1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,250
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:11,860
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,120
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:20,330
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,730
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,880
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,760
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,650
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:33,320
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,800
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:40,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,540
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,040
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,620
(Based on Hongshu.com's novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,650
=Episode 16=

17
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:53,759
That little witch in the Cold Palace

18
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:56,479
went to His Majesty's chambers again.

19
00:00:57,399 --> 00:00:58,200
Hmph.

20
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:02,000
That Lu girl has won his favor

21
00:01:02,039 --> 00:01:03,280
and performed a great service.

22
00:01:04,319 --> 00:01:06,959
Once everyone is eating her grain,

23
00:01:07,439 --> 00:01:10,040
will there still be a place for me here?

24
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:13,480
(Your Majesty.)

25
00:01:13,480 --> 00:01:16,640
(Consort Yao and General Bai are here.)

26
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:18,840
Send them in.

27
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:29,560
(Bai Zhenhai)

28
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:31,920
Greetings, Your Majesty.

29
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:34,280
Cousin.

30
00:01:44,239 --> 00:01:46,599
Greetings, Aunt.

31
00:01:49,079 --> 00:01:49,920
Be seated.

32
00:01:55,239 --> 00:01:56,840
Mother caught a chill yesterday

33
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,200
and missed your birthday feast.

34
00:01:58,359 --> 00:02:00,560
She asked me to bring you this

35
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:01,760
with her best wishes.

36
00:02:02,159 --> 00:02:03,200
She's ill?

37
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,200
Why wasn't I told?

38
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:07,040
Father stayed at the border so long and
only returned yesterday.

39
00:02:07,159 --> 00:02:09,319
You must have forgotten where home is.

40
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:12,280
Your father is always away fighting.

41
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:15,080
He can hardly look after you both.

42
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,840
It's understandable.

43
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:17,919
Father.

44
00:02:19,319 --> 00:02:21,159
But that Lu girl...

45
00:02:21,879 --> 00:02:24,599
I don't know why His Majesty favors her.

46
00:02:25,319 --> 00:02:28,400
She thwarts your daughter at every turn.

47
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,919
Life in the palace...

48
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:33,080
It's all that witch Lu Yunluo's fault!

49
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,639
Father!

50
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:35,599
Hmph.

51
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:39,319
I'll ask His Majesty to depose her!

52
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:42,879
A traitor's daughter dares rival mine?

53
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,960
You've just returned victorious.

54
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,639
If you petition him on your war record,

55
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,599
it could look like you're coercing him.

56
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:54,039
I have a better idea.

57
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,280
Your Majesty.

58
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:58,759
Countless lives depend on this wheat.

59
00:02:59,039 --> 00:03:02,199
The Empress cannot bear this task alone.

60
00:03:03,199 --> 00:03:04,400
I humbly suggest

61
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:06,159
that Consort Yao assist her.

62
00:03:06,159 --> 00:03:08,039
She could offer guidance.

63
00:03:08,159 --> 00:03:10,879
It would show Your Majesty's fairness.

64
00:03:13,919 --> 00:03:15,599
Guidance?

65
00:03:16,199 --> 00:03:19,400
I never knew Consort Yao could farm.

66
00:03:21,159 --> 00:03:22,639
My daughter may not know farming,

67
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:24,240
but she feels the people's pain.

68
00:03:24,599 --> 00:03:25,680
Drought ravages the land.

69
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:27,319
The border troops need food.

70
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:29,719
I've covered the shortfalls myself.

71
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:32,599
No one wants this wheat more than I do,

72
00:03:33,319 --> 00:03:35,639
to feed our soldiers for battle.

73
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:40,759
Another helping hand can only do good.

74
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,840
Please consider it, Your Majesty.

75
00:03:43,479 --> 00:03:46,199
Please consider it, Your Majesty.

76
00:03:51,599 --> 00:03:52,680
Hmph.

77
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,520
You care for your men like a father.

78
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:15,599
That pleases me greatly.

79
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:18,160
I've heard

80
00:04:18,839 --> 00:04:20,399
the sandstorms of Mobei

81
00:04:20,519 --> 00:04:23,360
can devour 10,000 mu of fertile fields
overnight.

82
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:25,079
Do you know

83
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:27,839
what snapping wheat stalks sound like?

84
00:04:29,399 --> 00:04:30,519
I do not.

85
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:32,680
Please enlighten me, Your Majesty.

86
00:04:37,639 --> 00:04:38,839
Just like

87
00:04:39,839 --> 00:04:41,360
a halberd breaking.

88
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:48,560
Cao Zhongquan.

89
00:04:48,759 --> 00:04:49,759
Yes, Your Majesty.

90
00:04:49,759 --> 00:04:51,000
Draw up a decree.

91
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,680
Effective immediately,

92
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:55,120
create an Agriculture Supervisor post.

93
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:59,720
Consort Yao and the Empress shall
jointly oversee the miracle wheat.

94
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:01,399
Yes, Your Majesty.

95
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:09,000
Thank you for your grace, Your Majesty.

96
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:13,319
Given your advanced years, General,

97
00:05:13,319 --> 00:05:15,759
you need no longer kneel at court.

98
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,319
Court is dismissed.

99
00:05:18,279 --> 00:05:19,519
Thank you, Your Majesty.

100
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:41,800
Your Majesty.

101
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:44,079
This wheat may seem a matter of farming,

102
00:05:44,079 --> 00:05:45,240
but it shapes our nation's fate.

103
00:05:45,399 --> 00:05:46,680
Whoever grows it

104
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,959
will be hailed as the people's savior.

105
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:51,879
General Bai's request today...

106
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,279
Hmph.

107
00:05:54,639 --> 00:05:56,120
He wants command of the troops

108
00:05:56,519 --> 00:05:57,959
and control of the grain.

109
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:01,800
Hundreds of thousands of horsemen aren't
enough for him.

110
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:05,600
What an insatiable wolf.

111
00:06:07,839 --> 00:06:09,199
I heard

112
00:06:09,199 --> 00:06:11,600
he visited Ningxin Palace yesterday.

113
00:06:12,199 --> 00:06:13,240
Oh?

114
00:06:14,879 --> 00:06:16,879
I thought he was just a brute.

115
00:06:17,639 --> 00:06:18,439
Hmph.

116
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:21,079
So the Empress Dowager is behind this.

117
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:24,399
Her roots have gripped the court for
decades.

118
00:06:25,399 --> 00:06:27,720
Her branches blot out the sun.

119
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:30,319
Once I expose each of those roots,

120
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:32,920
I'll tear the whole tree out.

121
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:37,360
What shall we tell the Empress?

122
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:39,720
You tell her.

123
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:42,920
Yes, Your Majesty.

124
00:06:48,879 --> 00:06:50,160
(Cold Palace)
By Heaven's will,

125
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:51,839
His Majesty decrees:

126
00:06:51,839 --> 00:06:52,879
Empress Lu...

127
00:06:52,879 --> 00:06:54,040
Hey!

128
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:56,680
I refuse! Let someone else take it!

129
00:06:56,839 --> 00:06:57,959
Your Majesty, please!

130
00:06:57,959 --> 00:06:59,959
Your whole clan could be executed!

131
00:06:59,959 --> 00:07:01,160
Then execute them!

132
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,720
I'm the only Lu left anyway.

133
00:07:03,639 --> 00:07:04,839
Your... Your Majesty!

134
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:06,920
Hmph.

135
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:09,720
Now you dare throw away my decree?

136
00:07:10,839 --> 00:07:12,600
Who passed off nonsense as a decree?

137
00:07:12,759 --> 00:07:15,480
We've worked with the Agriculture Office
for months!

138
00:07:15,600 --> 00:07:17,680
Was it all just a game, Your Majesty?

139
00:07:19,199 --> 00:07:20,360
I had no idea

140
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:22,439
you could curse with such vigor.

141
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:25,199
Why not use every insult you know?

142
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,639
Let me hear them.

143
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:28,480
You!

144
00:07:28,519 --> 00:07:29,959
I know you're angry.

145
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,639
I didn't want this either.

146
00:07:33,839 --> 00:07:36,480
Your Majesty, His Majesty had no choice.

147
00:07:36,519 --> 00:07:38,399
Her father commands a vast army,

148
00:07:38,399 --> 00:07:40,360
and the Empress Dowager backs him.

149
00:07:42,439 --> 00:07:43,560
They just get in my way!

150
00:07:47,959 --> 00:07:49,120
Once the wheat is harvested,

151
00:07:49,399 --> 00:07:51,319
I'll reward you handsomely.

152
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,720
I planted other crops too.

153
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:56,560
Oh?

154
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:57,279
Your Majesty.

155
00:07:57,399 --> 00:07:57,720
Yes?

156
00:07:58,439 --> 00:07:59,480
The sweet potatoes are done.

157
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:02,560
Your Majesty is here too!

158
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,439
What are these?

159
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:10,279
I found this promising new crop

160
00:08:10,279 --> 00:08:11,600
in the hills a few days ago.

161
00:08:11,639 --> 00:08:13,439
They yield five times as much as wheat.

162
00:08:15,199 --> 00:08:16,000
How...

163
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:16,839
How much?

164
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,519
About 500,000 taels.

165
00:08:20,959 --> 00:08:22,680
Converting to this era's measures...

166
00:08:23,759 --> 00:08:26,000
I've planted 100 mu of potatoes,

167
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:27,240
along with other crops.

168
00:08:27,279 --> 00:08:29,000
At least 5,000 shi in all.

169
00:08:29,639 --> 00:08:30,480
5,000 shi?

170
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:31,040
Yes.

171
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:33,519
But...

172
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:38,840
The northern army's yearly rations

173
00:08:38,879 --> 00:08:40,240
are just over 10,000 shi!

174
00:08:40,519 --> 00:08:41,360
Your Majesty.

175
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:42,919
It's nearly time.

176
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:45,000
The Grand Commandant and Chief Censor

177
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,399
await you in Shuxin Hall.

178
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:56,200
Donglan

179
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,120
is blessed to have you.

180
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:03,639
Cao Zhongquan.

181
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:05,679
Bring all of these back with us.

182
00:09:05,679 --> 00:09:06,480
Yes, Your Majesty.

183
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:13,279
My lady!

184
00:09:13,639 --> 00:09:14,919
My lady, something's wrong!

185
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:15,279
What?

186
00:09:15,279 --> 00:09:16,919
Something's happened to our trial field!

187
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,240
What?

188
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:26,080
Consort Yao appreciates your hard work.

189
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:27,639
5 taels for each of you.

190
00:09:28,759 --> 00:09:29,440
(Thank you!)

191
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:30,480
(Thank you, Your Highness.)

192
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:36,000
Oh!

193
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:46,320
My vegetables!

194
00:09:48,159 --> 00:09:49,480
My sweet potatoes!

195
00:09:51,879 --> 00:09:53,320
My lady.

196
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,639
5,000 shi of grain,

197
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:57,440
all destroyed.

198
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:59,960
Look at you, Sister.

199
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:03,039
You're in worse shape than these weeds.

200
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,679
Who told you to pull them up?

201
00:10:07,360 --> 00:10:09,759
His Majesty gave you this wheat seed,

202
00:10:10,039 --> 00:10:12,159
yet you let the field fill with weeds.

203
00:10:12,639 --> 00:10:13,759
Now,

204
00:10:13,759 --> 00:10:15,480
with no weeds stealing its nutrients,

205
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:17,480
the wheat will flourish.

206
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,320
I said,

207
00:10:20,519 --> 00:10:22,960
who told you to pull them up?

208
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,559
How dare you hit me!

209
00:10:24,559 --> 00:10:25,200
Insolent woman!

210
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,919
How dare you strike Her Highness!

211
00:10:26,919 --> 00:10:27,879
Say one more word

212
00:10:27,879 --> 00:10:29,679
and I'll bury you here as fertilizer.

213
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:31,440
So what if I pulled them up?

214
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:34,039
How can weeds rival miracle wheat?

215
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,679
A wretch from the Cold Palace

216
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:37,200
can never rival a phoenix like me.

217
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:39,080
Ever heard of companion planting?

218
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:42,039
Alfalfa adds nitrogen to the soil.

219
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,600
Garlic deters pests and disease.

220
00:10:44,279 --> 00:10:45,679
Those weeds you pulled up

221
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:48,320
would have boosted the yield by 30%.

222
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:49,840
They're just a few weeds.

223
00:10:49,919 --> 00:10:51,120
I'll pay for them.

224
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:53,440
That grain wasn't mine.

225
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:56,399
It belonged to the people of Donglan.

226
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:58,080
Stop acting so righteous.

227
00:10:58,279 --> 00:11:01,000
Without my father's 100,000 cavalrymen,

228
00:11:01,159 --> 00:11:03,200
those peasants would all be dead!

229
00:11:04,559 --> 00:11:05,759
Fine.

230
00:11:05,759 --> 00:11:07,200
When harvest comes,

231
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:10,919
let's see how you feed his 100,000 men.

232
00:11:10,919 --> 00:11:11,519
You!

233
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:19,679
What a sin!

234
00:11:20,519 --> 00:11:22,600
Tens of thousands depended on this!

235
00:11:22,799 --> 00:11:26,200
This will cut off Donglan's lifeline!

236
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,039
I...

237
00:11:58,040 --> 00:12:02,070
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

238
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:06,620
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

239
00:12:06,660 --> 00:12:10,840
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

240
00:12:10,900 --> 00:12:15,090
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

241
00:12:15,430 --> 00:12:19,490
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

242
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:23,740
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

243
00:12:24,180 --> 00:12:27,550
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

244
00:12:28,020 --> 00:12:32,700
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

245
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:36,510
♪No finery to rival spring♪

246
00:12:36,690 --> 00:12:40,990
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

247
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:45,150
♪Where is beauty found?♪

248
00:12:45,330 --> 00:12:49,760
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

249
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:51,890
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

250
00:12:51,910 --> 00:12:54,380
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

251
00:12:54,450 --> 00:12:56,530
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

252
00:12:56,690 --> 00:12:58,460
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

253
00:12:59,070 --> 00:13:00,340
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

254
00:13:00,570 --> 00:13:02,970
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

255
00:13:03,210 --> 00:13:05,510
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

256
00:13:05,790 --> 00:13:10,110
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
